# Build-context excludes — lean image, reproducible wheel.
# Patterns without `**` are top-level only and `*` does not cross `/`, so
# `*.md` drops root docs (README, IDEA, PLAN, …) while keeping the bundled
# src/lore/prompts/*.md that the wheel needs.
.git
.github
.claude
.venv
tests
references
docs
deploy
dist
build
*.md
docker-compose.yml
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
